# Fonts — Yekan Bakh Pro

## Canonical files

- Panel font files live under `frontend/public/fonts/yekan-bakh/` (`woff2/`, `woff/`, `variable/`).
- Source of truth for copies: `/mnt/Mine/Software/Fonts/Yekan Bakh (Pro) @MafiaFont` (Webfonts + Variable).
- Loader: `frontend/src/lib/fonts/yekan-bakh.ts` via `next/font/local` → CSS variable `--font-yekan`.

## Usage

- Root layout applies `yekanBakh.variable` on `<body>`.
- Tailwind / theme maps `--font-sans` to `var(--font-yekan)`.
- Do not introduce a second primary UI font for the admin/dashboard without updating this loader and settings.

## When updating fonts

1. Copy Pro webfonts into `public/fonts/yekan-bakh/{woff2,woff,variable}/`.
2. Keep weight map in `yekan-bakh.ts` aligned with available files (100–950).
3. Do not commit license PDFs into the app public tree.
